1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:01,074
You're Qin Shuang,

2
00:00:01,266 --> 00:00:02,559
that's all that matters to me.

3
00:00:04,427 --> 00:00:05,787
Qin Shuang, affection:

4
00:00:06,443 --> 00:00:08,685
plus four, fifty-two.

5
00:00:08,759 --> 00:00:10,327
Idiot.

6
00:00:10,556 --> 00:00:12,562
Only an idiot knows for sure.

7
00:00:12,871 --> 00:00:15,183
I said I was a soldier's orphan,

8
00:00:15,259 --> 00:00:16,784
that was a lie.

9
00:00:17,223 --> 00:00:18,027
A general's family,

10
00:00:18,080 --> 00:00:19,616
still counts as military, right?

11
00:00:19,715 --> 00:00:21,641
Harboring a convict's daughter,

12
00:00:21,718 --> 00:00:23,059
aren't you scared?

13
00:00:23,381 --> 00:00:23,873
Sure I am.

14
00:00:24,140 --> 00:00:25,585
Scared you'll run off.

15
00:00:25,648 --> 00:00:27,310
About me being a convict's daughter,

16
00:00:27,608 --> 00:00:29,216
don't let a third person know.

17
00:00:29,288 --> 00:00:30,746
My lips are sealed.

18
00:00:34,172 --> 00:00:35,387
Qin Lieshan…

19
00:00:35,453 --> 00:00:37,187
A convict's daughter?

20
00:00:39,002 --> 00:00:40,476
Now that's worth something.

21
00:00:42,612 --> 00:00:43,495
Two more days till the results?

22
00:00:44,325 --> 00:00:45,880
I can't wait!

23
00:00:46,179 --> 00:00:46,933
The list is a secret,

24
00:00:47,669 --> 00:00:48,586
nobody gets to see it.

25
00:00:49,037 --> 00:00:50,015
Secrets,

26
00:00:50,069 --> 00:00:51,240
all have a price.

27
00:00:53,638 --> 00:00:55,486
Soldiers guard the results office.

28
00:00:55,563 --> 00:00:56,430
Soldiers guard the door,

29
00:00:56,485 --> 00:00:58,515
the clerk's wife guards the kitchen.

30
00:00:58,870 --> 00:00:59,471
White sugar?

31
00:00:59,791 --> 00:01:00,688
A whole box?

32
00:01:01,168 --> 00:01:01,646
One look,

33
00:01:01,736 --> 00:01:02,427
just one!

34
00:01:05,262 --> 00:01:06,503
Qingshui County…

35
00:01:06,574 --> 00:01:07,111
Xu…

36
00:01:07,169 --> 00:01:08,352
It's not here?

37
00:01:08,407 --> 00:01:09,115
Done yet?

38
00:01:09,181 --> 00:01:09,826
Hurry!

39
00:01:09,911 --> 00:01:12,218
Draw water with waterwheels…

40
00:01:12,549 --> 00:01:14,190
This is his essay.

41
00:01:16,923 --> 00:01:17,713
Your name,

42
00:01:18,446 --> 00:01:19,263
isn't on the list.

43
00:01:19,580 --> 00:01:20,193
Not there?

44
00:01:22,780 --> 00:01:23,731
The top of the list is Wei Xun,

45
00:01:23,919 --> 00:01:26,292
and his policy essay is about waterwheels.
